  "rationale": "Setting --remove_ribo_rna true uses the default tool, SortMeRNA, and the default ribo_database_manifest. The reference step decompresses the gzipped rRNA FASTAs from the manifest, and PREPARE_GENOME_INDICES builds a SortMeRNA index because none is supplied. SortMeRNA and its fq lint check then run after BBSplit. Every step that consumes the filtered reads gets new inputs and reruns: post-filter FastQC, strandedness subsampling, STAR alignment and all BAM QC, coverage, quantification, DESeq2 QC and MultiQC. Steps before rRNA removal (cat, lint, trimming, BBSplit) and genome preparation are unchanged."
